'''Rutian''' referred to one of the many skin tones of the [[Twi'lek]] [[species]], generally denoting a [[color|shade]] of blue.<ref name="CVD" />

Rutian Twi'leks included [[Jedi Master]] [[Aayla Secura]],<ref name="Ep II" /> [[Jedi]] [[Padawan]]s [[Vix Fonnick]]<ref name="Quest of the Jedi">''[[The High Republic Adventures: Quest of the Jedi]]''</ref> and [[Eldra Kaitis]],<ref name="Maul 2" /> [[twin]] masseuses [[Ann Gella]] and [[Tann Gella]],<ref name="TPM" /> [[Twi'lek Resistance]] member [[Gobi Glie]],<ref name="Liberty">{{TCW|Liberty on Ryloth}}</ref> [[Free Ryloth Movement]] member [[Isval]],<ref name="Lords of the Sith">''[[Lords of the Sith]]''</ref> Free Ryloth movement strategist [[Kaasha Bateen]],<ref name="LS">''[[Last Shot]]''</ref> [[Alliance to Restore the Republic|Rebel]] [[pilot]] [[Yendor Brethen]],<ref name="Lost Stars">''[[Lost Stars]]''</ref> and [[Galactic Republic]] [[Senator]] [[Orn Free Taa]].<ref name="Ep II" />

{{Species-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
On page 19 of the [[2018]] reference book ''[[Star Wars: The Complete Visual Dictionary, New Edition]]'', "Rutian" was misspelled as "Ruttian."<ref name="CVD" />

